                "title": "42 Inch Modern Offset Surface Bolt, Deltana FPGM42",
                "description": "Deltana FPGM42 - The extra long 42 inch modern offset door bolts made of heavy duty solid brass and is available in 4 different finishes. The guides are held in place with a unique ball bearing system that eliminates scratches on the barrel of the bolt, prevents rattling of the bolt, holds the bolt in any position, and ensures a smooth sliding action. Each 42 inch modern offset surface bolt is supplied with 3 strikes: universal, mortise, and angle strike with matching solid brass phillip's head screws.",
